\n## non-interactive slash command: /skills list
Available skills in this session:

**Ralph orchestration (plugin)**
- `analyze-iteration` – Post-iteration analysis (Progress Analyst, rollback, Story Doctor, Quality Gate, Refactoring Pass)
- `brainstorm-with-ralph` – Multi-model brainstorming before planning
- `convert-to-ralph-prd` – Convert existing PRDs to Ralph's prd.json format
- `create-prd` – Generate a PRD for a new feature
- `decompose-plan` – Break an implementation plan into parallel job group
- `edit-prd` – Interactively edit an existing prd.json
- `implement-with-ralph` – End-to-end implementation workflow (plan → PRD → Ralph loop → review)
- `list-jobs` – Browse Ralph jobs for the current repo
- `parallel-ralph` – Parallel execution orchestrator for job groups
- `plan-with-ralph` – Parallel codebase research + multi-model planning
- `review-changes` – Code + security review of Ralph changes
- `review-plan-with-ralph` – Review and iteratively fix an implementation plan
- `run-ralph` – Run the Ralph autonomous agent loop

**DevUI (plugin)**
- `debug-conversation` – Debug a Sydney/TuringBot conversation
- `send-and-debug` – Send a chat request to Sydney and debug telemetry
- `setup-config` – Create/fork a chat request config for local debugging

**Ralph overview (plugin)**
- `blocker-report` – Surface blocked tasks / open findings / deferred questions
- `overview-init` – Initialize a repo for ralph-overview via MCP
- `triage` – Rank Ralph-tracked tasks needing attention
- `work-on` – Resume a Ralph-tracked task by id

**Project skills (this repo)**
- `publish-packages` – Publish TypeScript MCP server plugins via GitHub Releases
- `release-plugin` – Ship a new version of a plugin (bumps manifest, indexes, changelog, pushes to remotes)
- `sync-options-mode` – Sync standalone Evyatar108/options-mode repo from monorepo

**Built-in**
- `customize-cloud-agent` – Configure Copilot cloud agent / copilot-setup-steps.yml

Invoke any of these by name (e.g. `/triage`, `/list-jobs`, `/implement-with-ralph`).

